model own10_p02
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-30
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-01-31
  note "OWN-10 P-02: a transfer between two owned accounts keeps its labels: the arrival rule's moved rule gives each party what the leg took of its parts over what it took (LANGUAGE 3.6, 5.14)."
  note "The transfer takes the couple's part of sav_a first (R3)."

source card "Probe card OWN-10 (made up): story and rules"

source bank "The couple's bank: its January 2026 rows (made up)"

unit DUK: currency minor 0.01

kind couples: parties

kind persons: parties

kind inheritances: transfers
  attr heir: key parties

kind savings: place DUK min 0
  owned by arrive
  step minor(DUK)
  takes k for w order (if k.owner == ania_tomek then 0 else 1)

place sav_a: savings lives 2026-01-01..

place sav_b: savings lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input bank_rows: observed

def arrive[m in events, p in parties]: num at m.day
  note "R1: an inheritance the heir's, any other arrival the couple's; R2: money moved from an owned account keeps its labels"
  rule community v card_rules = (if p == ania_tomek then 1 else 0)
  rule inherited beats community v card_rules = (if p == m.heir then 1 else 0) when m in inheritances
  rule moved beats community, inherited v card_rules = m.cash.amount of p / m.cash.amount when m in transfers and m.cash.from in savings

ask q_parts: bal(x, 2026-01-31) of p for x in savings on 2026-01-31, p in parties on 2026-01-31

version card_cast
  cite card
  known 2026-01-01
  note "the parties: things of the prelude kind parties, of the model's own subkinds"
  couples + [ania_tomek] lives 2015-06-20..
  persons + [ania] lives 1988-04-12..
  persons + [tomek] lives 1986-09-03..

version card_rules
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01

version records_2026_01
  cite bank
  governs 2026-01
  known 2026-02-03
  bank_rows[r1] = (on: 2026-01-05, kind: inheritances, leg cash from world to sav_a amount 2000.00 DUK, heir: ania) "line 1"
  bank_rows[r2] = (on: 2026-01-08, kind: transfers, leg cash from world to sav_a amount 1000.00 DUK) "line 2"
  bank_rows[r3] = (on: 2026-01-20, kind: transfers, leg cash from sav_a to sav_b amount 1800.00 DUK) "line 3"
